<title>USA: US House budget panel to take up budget resolution.</title>
<headline>US House budget panel to take up budget resolution.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The House Budget Committee said Tuesday it would consider the fiscal 1998 budget resolution Wednesday at 1400 EDT/1800 GMT.</p>
<p>The committee will discuss any amendments offered to the budget framework.</p>
<p>The White House and congressional leaders reached agreement on a broad outline of a plan to balance the budget by 2002 on May 2.</p>
</text>
